<title>UK: UK's Beckett, van Miert held meeting on BA.</title>
<headline>UK's Beckett, van Miert held meeting on BA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Trade Secretary Margaret Beckett met European Competition Commissioner Karel van Miert in London earlier on Tuesday to discuss the proposed alliance between British Airways Plc and AMR Corp's American Airlines unit, a spokesman for her office said.</p>
<p>He had no details on the meeting and no immediate comment on a Reuter report from Brussels that van Miert had concluded that the proposed alliance would harm fair competition unless changed.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom 44-171-542 7767</p>
